k on a hilarious journey, facing challenges and learning the true meaning of friendship.',	'poster_176.png',	'{"title":"Armadillo Adventures","runtime_mins":131,"genres":"kids, comedy, adventure","rating":"2.0","released":2005,"actors":"Jason Chow,  Caleb Cook","director":"Fatima Said","plot":"Arlo, a young armadillo with a thirst for adventure, dreams of escaping his dusty desert home. When a traveling circus arrives, Arlo sees his chance. He stows away in a clown''s suitcase, only to find himself in a world of dazzling lights, strange creatures, and a mischievous monkey named Coco. Together, they embark on a hilarious journey, facing challenges and learning the true meaning of friendship."}'),
