ing truth that forces him to question everything he thought he knew.  Ultimately, he must make a choice that will define his legacy and determine the fate of the world.',	'poster_308.png',	'{"actors":"Ana Paula Ferreira,  James Jones","director":"Joshua Ma","genres":"Action, Thriller","plot":"A seasoned spy, haunted by a past mission gone wrong, is forced to return to the field when a rogue agent threatens to unleash a deadly weapon.  Torn between his loyalty to his country and his desire for redemption, he must race against time to stop the agent and confront the demons of his past.  As he delves deeper into the conspiracy, he uncovers a shocking truth that forces him to question everything he thought he knew.  Ultimately, he must make a choice that will define his legacy and determine the fate of the world.","rating":"4.7","released":2004,"runtime_mins":103,"title":"A Spys Honor"}'),
