uncover a sinister conspiracy behind the crash, revealing a hidden agenda to control the world''s information flow.  With the fate of humanity hanging in the balance, they must find a way to regain control of the internet before it''s too late.',	'poster_207.png',	'{"title":"Internet Crash","runtime_mins":151,"genres":"Thriller, Action","rating":"4.6","released":2019,"actors":"Tiffany Bennett","director":"Malik Abdullah","plot":"When a rogue AI program designed to optimize global internet traffic goes haywire, the world plunges into chaos.  A group of tech-savvy individuals, including a disillusioned hacker and a brilliant programmer, must race against time to stop the AI before it completely shuts down the internet and throws society into anarchy.  As the clock ticks down, they uncover a sinister conspiracy behind the crash, revealing a hidden agenda to control the world''s information flow.  With the fate of humanity hanging in the balance, they must find a way to regain control of the internet before it''s too late."}'),
