ectives and help him rediscover his passions.  Ultimately, he learns to embrace the present and find joy in the simple things, returning home a changed man.',	'poster_401.png',	'{"actors":"Ishani Chatterjee","director":"Amina Mohamed","genres":"Drama, Adventure","plot":"A jaded, workaholic architect, disillusioned with his life, inherits a dilapidated sailboat from his estranged grandfather.  Forced to confront his own emotional baggage, he embarks on a solo sailing journey, navigating treacherous waters both literal and metaphorical.  Along the way, he encounters a diverse cast of characters who challenge his perspectives and help him rediscover his passions.  Ultimately, he learns to embrace the present and find joy in the simple things, returning home a changed man.","rating":"4.4","released":2015,"runtime_mins":66,"title":"Journey of Self-Discovery"}'),
