within the hospital.  Ultimately, he must choose between protecting his reputation or exposing the truth, even if it means sacrificing everything.',	'poster_121.png',	'{"title":"A Broken Soul","runtime_mins":46,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"2.1","released":2017,"actors":"Alexander Weber,  Sakura Sato","director":"Sameer Khan","plot":"A renowned surgeon, haunted by a past medical error that cost a patient''s life, struggles to cope with the guilt and shame.  His world crumbles further when he is accused of malpractice in a new case, forcing him to confront his demons and fight for his career and sanity.  As he delves deeper into the truth, he uncovers a conspiracy that threatens to expose a dark secret within the hospital.  Ultimately, he must choose between protecting his reputation or exposing the truth, even if it means sacrificing everything."}'),
