e to care for, facing a battle against both the corporation and his own prejudices.  In the process, he rediscovers the joy of life and the importance of connection, learning that even the most hardened hearts can be softened by the magic of the sea.',	'poster_216.png',	'{"actors":"Karan Joshi,  Riya Das,  Julieta Navarro","director":"Kofi Annan","genres":"Fantasy, Comedy","plot":"Arthur, a grumpy old man living on a remote island, discovers a young mermaid trapped in a fishing net.  He reluctantly takes her in, but their unlikely bond is tested when a greedy corporation arrives, seeking to exploit the mermaid''s unique abilities for profit.  Arthur must choose between his own comfort and protecting the creature he''s come to care for, facing a battle against both the corporation and his own prejudices.  In the process, he rediscovers the joy of life and the importance of connection, learning that even the most hardened hearts can be softened by the magic of the sea.","rating":"1.9","released":2013,"runtime_mins":110,"title":"Mr. Mermaid"}'),
