g woman with a dark past, begins to suspect his true intentions.  As Ethan''s manipulations spiral out of control, he must confront the consequences of his actions and the true nature of his own darkness.  The line between healer and deceiver blurs, leaving Ethan to question his own sanity and the morality',	'poster_314.png',	'{"actors":"Ng Wai Tung,  Andrew Thompson","director":"Hannah Schneider","genres":"Thriller, Drama","plot":"A brilliant but troubled psychiatrist, Dr. Ethan Reed, uses his knowledge of the human mind to manipulate and control his patients, believing he''s helping them by erasing their pain.  However, his methods become increasingly dangerous, and he finds himself entangled in a web of deceit and violence when one of his patients, a young woman with a dark past, begins to suspect his true intentions.  As Ethan''s manipulations spiral out of control, he must confront the consequences of his actions and the true nature of his own darkness.  The line between healer and deceiver blurs, leaving Ethan to question his own sanity and the morality","rating":"4.6","released":2008,"runtime_mins":69,"title":"The Deceiver"}'),
