he competition, they learn to embrace their differences and discover a hidden talent for creating music that is both hilarious and heartwarming.  In the end, they realize that the true reward is the bond they''ve forged and the joy they''ve brought to others.',	'poster_222.png',	'{"actors":"Jamila Ibrahim,  Victoria Cook,  Michael Ng","director":"Joshua Ma","genres":"Comedy,  Drama","plot":"The Office Band, a group of misfit office workers, decides to enter a local battle of the bands competition.  Their lack of musical talent and chaotic rehearsals are a constant source of amusement for their coworkers, but they find unexpected success when their quirky, off-key performances resonate with the audience.  As they navigate the competition, they learn to embrace their differences and discover a hidden talent for creating music that is both hilarious and heartwarming.  In the end, they realize that the true reward is the bond they''ve forged and the joy they''ve brought to others.","rating":"4.8","released":2021,"runtime_mins":116,"title":"The Office Band"}'),
