ny embarks on a desperate journey to atone for her past, seeking redemption and a chance to rewrite the tragic narrative she set in motion.',	'poster_40.png',	'{"title":"Atonement","runtime_mins":39,"genres":"drama, thriller","rating":"2.8","released":2015,"actors":"Samuel Price,  Simran Kaur","director":"Matthew Martin","plot":"In the sweltering heat of a summer afternoon, a young girl, Briony, witnesses a disturbing scene between her older sister and a family friend. Driven by a misguided sense of justice and a thirst for attention, she accuses the man of a crime he did not commit, shattering the lives of everyone involved. Years later, haunted by the consequences of her actions, Briony embarks on a desperate journey to atone for her past, seeking redemption and a chance to rewrite the tragic narrative she set in motion."}'),
