rmance, and the true meaning of "playing himself."  Ultimately, he must confront the consequences of blurring the lines between his public and private persona.',	'poster_228.png',	'{"actors":"Katherine Simmons,  Luka Kovac","director":"David Hoffmann","genres":"Drama, Comedy","plot":"A struggling actor, tired of playing characters, decides to take a radical approach to his career: he will only play himself.  His agent scoffs, but the media frenzy surrounding his \"authenticity\" propels him to unexpected fame.  However, as his personal life becomes increasingly public, he begins to question the line between reality and performance, and the true meaning of \"playing himself.\"  Ultimately, he must confront the consequences of blurring the lines between his public and private persona.","rating":"1.7","released":2024,"runtime_mins":69,"title":"Playing Myself"}'),
