 confrontation that forces them to confront their own values and the true meaning of friendship.  In the end, they learn that true friendship is priceless and worth fighting for, even when faced with the allure of wealth and power.',	'poster_410.png',	'{"actors":"Tommaso Pellegrini,  Mariana Barros,  Ava Davies","director":"Elizabeth Collins","genres":"Drama, Thriller","plot":"Three childhood friends, now adults, find their bond tested when one of them inherits a vast fortune.  As the wealth brings new opportunities and temptations, the friends must navigate the shifting dynamics and decide if their friendship is truly valuable enough to withstand the pressure.  One friend, consumed by greed, betrays the others, leading to a dramatic confrontation that forces them to confront their own values and the true meaning of friendship.  In the end, they learn that true friendship is priceless and worth fighting for, even when faced with the allure of wealth and power.","rating":"4.0","released":2011,"runtime_mins":174,"title":"Value of Friendship"}'),
