n returns to the stage, ready to face his fears and win over the audience.  But his journey to redemption is fraught with unexpected challenges, forcing him to confront his past and discover his true voice.',	'poster_233.png',	'{"actors":"Julieta Barbosa,  Mary Johnson,  Jennifer Wong","director":"Nurbolat Akhmetov","genres":"comedy, drama","plot":"A talented but nervous comedian, struggling to make it big, gets booed off stage during his biggest break yet.  Devastated, he seeks the help of a legendary but reclusive comedian, who teaches him the true meaning of laughter and the power of resilience.  Armed with newfound confidence and a unique perspective, the comedian returns to the stage, ready to face his fears and win over the audience.  But his journey to redemption is fraught with unexpected challenges, forcing him to confront his past and discover his true voice.","rating":"3.7","released":2021,"runtime_mins":95,"title":"Booed Off Stage"}'),
