d, and his own hardened heart begins to soften.  Ultimately, he must choose between clinging to his cynical worldview or embracing the possibility of something truly extraordinary.',	'poster_49.png',	'{"title":"A Realists Truth","runtime_mins":87,"genres":"Drama, Thriller","rating":"3.9","released":2010,"actors":"Juliette Petit,  Julieta Navarro","director":"Rebecca Nelson","plot":"A cynical, jaded journalist, known for his biting commentary on the absurdity of life, is forced to confront his own deeply held beliefs when he is assigned to cover a story about a seemingly impossible miracle. As he delves deeper into the investigation, he finds himself questioning everything he thought he knew about the world, and his own hardened heart begins to soften.  Ultimately, he must choose between clinging to his cynical worldview or embracing the possibility of something truly extraordinary."}'),
