al, he realizes the true cost of eternal peace might be far greater than he ever imagined.  Will he sacrifice everything for a world without war, or will he choose to embrace the complexities of life, even with its inherent pain?',	'poster_324.png',	'{"actors":"Lam Yan Yan,  Shirin Ebadi,  Zoya Ali","director":"Martín Pereira","genres":"Action, Fantasy","plot":"In a world ravaged by endless war, a young soldier named Kai discovers an ancient artifact rumored to grant eternal peace.  Driven by a desperate hope for a world without conflict, he embarks on a perilous journey to activate the artifact, facing both internal and external threats.  However, as Kai gets closer to his goal, he realizes the true cost of eternal peace might be far greater than he ever imagined.  Will he sacrifice everything for a world without war, or will he choose to embrace the complexities of life, even with its inherent pain?","rating":"2.6","released":2021,"runtime_mins":90,"title":"Eternal Peace"}'),
