gues, and the realization that their feelings for each other might be more than just a ploy for survival.  As their charade unravels, they must decide if their newfound love is worth risking everything for, or if they should return to their separate lives.',	'poster_245.png',	'{"actors":"Julien David,  Amanda Ng,  Lam Wai Man","director":"Maximilian Fischer","genres":"Romance, Comedy","plot":"A high-powered, workaholic CEO, desperate to avoid deportation back to her native Canada, hatches a plan to propose to her long-suffering assistant, a kind-hearted but cynical man.  Their fake engagement quickly spirals into a whirlwind of chaos and unexpected romance as they navigate family dinners, awkward encounters with their colleagues, and the realization that their feelings for each other might be more than just a ploy for survival.  As their charade unravels, they must decide if their newfound love is worth risking everything for, or if they should return to their separate lives.","rating":"3.2","released":2024,"runtime_mins":48,"title":"The Proposal"}'),
