orcing him to make a life-altering choice: face his past or let the killer win.',	'poster_68.png',	'{"title":"Final Duty","runtime_mins":146,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"2.0","released":2022,"actors":"Brandon King,  Daniel Anderson","director":"Wong Pui Ying","plot":"A seasoned detective, haunted by a past case, is forced to confront his demons when a new serial killer emerges, mirroring the unsolved crimes from his past. As the body count rises, he must race against time to stop the killer before they claim their final victim, a young woman who holds the key to unraveling the truth.  But the detective''s own dark secrets threaten to derail his investigation, forcing him to make a life-altering choice: face his past or let the killer win."}'),
