 hidden secret from his past threatens to derail their dreams and shatter their newfound hope.',	'poster_262.png',	'{"actors":"Tiffany Parker,  Grace Jones","director":"Mohamed Salah","genres":"Drama, Romance","plot":"A jaded, retired tango dancer, haunted by a past love, is drawn back into the world of dance when a young, passionate student arrives at his doorstep seeking lessons. As they rehearse for a prestigious competition, their connection deepens, forcing him to confront his own regrets and rediscover the joy of movement. But a hidden secret from his past threatens to derail their dreams and shatter their newfound hope.","rating":"3.9","released":2018,"runtime_mins":61,"title":"Tango at Midnight"}'),
