 she takes towards self-acceptance.  In a climactic dance battle, she must choose between embracing her darkness or letting it consume her.',	'poster_580.png',	'{"actors":"Ethan Dubois,  Paul Fischer","director":"Sara Monti","genres":"Thriller, Fantasy","plot":"A young, gifted dancer, haunted by a mysterious shadow that mirrors her every move, discovers the shadow is a manifestation of her own repressed anger and trauma.  As she delves deeper into the source of her darkness, she must confront her past and learn to dance with the devil within, or risk losing herself entirely.  The shadow, however, has its own agenda, and its power grows with each step she takes towards self-acceptance.  In a climactic dance battle, she must choose between embracing her darkness or letting it consume her.","rating":"1.0","released":2010,"runtime_mins":163,"title":"Dance with the Devils Shadow"}'),
