ill determine the fate of both worlds, leading her on a perilous journey to confront the shadows of her past and the darkness that threatens to consume everything.',	'poster_339.png',	'{"actors":"Juliette Petit,  Tiffany Ho","director":"Lee Wai Shan","genres":"fantasy, action","plot":"In a world where angels and demons walk among humans, a young woman named Anya discovers she is a Seraph, a powerful angel with a hidden past.  Haunted by visions of a fallen angel, she must choose between her destiny as a protector of humanity and the allure of forbidden power.  As she unravels the secrets of her lineage, Anya faces a choice that will determine the fate of both worlds, leading her on a perilous journey to confront the shadows of her past and the darkness that threatens to consume everything.","rating":"4.7","released":2013,"runtime_mins":170,"title":"Seraph Shadows"}'),
