eking to exploit its power for their own nefarious purposes.  As she races against time to uncover the city''s secrets, she must confront her own inner demons and make a choice that will determine the fate of the world.',	'poster_585.png',	'{"actors":"Nadine Gordimer,  Ngaire Wilson,  Justin Allen","director":"Emil Huber","genres":"Action, Adventure, Fantasy","plot":"A young archaeologist, driven by a mysterious inscription on an ancient artifact, embarks on a perilous journey to find the legendary Forbidden City of Azarath, rumored to hold the key to unlocking a powerful, long-lost magic.  However, she soon discovers that the city is not only guarded by ancient traps and mythical creatures, but also by a sinister cult seeking to exploit its power for their own nefarious purposes.  As she races against time to uncover the city''s secrets, she must confront her own inner demons and make a choice that will determine the fate of the world.","rating":"3.1","released":2006,"runtime_mins":127,"title":"Forbidden City of Azarath"}'),
