 time to expose the truth and bring the real culprits to justice.  But in a world of shadows and secrets, can he trust anyone, even himself?',	'poster_294.png',	'{"actors":"Benjamín Campos","director":"Sophia Schmidt","genres":"Action, Thriller","plot":"A seasoned secret agent, haunted by a past mission gone wrong, is framed for a devastating attack and forced to go on the run.  As he fights to clear his name, he uncovers a conspiracy that reaches the highest levels of power, threatening to expose a network of corruption and betrayal.  With the clock ticking and his own life on the line, he must race against time to expose the truth and bring the real culprits to justice.  But in a world of shadows and secrets, can he trust anyone, even himself?","rating":"1.4","released":2001,"runtime_mins":83,"title":"Agents Absolution"}'),
