rabilities and fight for justice.  In a shocking twist, she discovers the missing child is not who they seem to be, and the truth is far more sinister than anyone could have imagined.',	'poster_299.png',	'{"actors":"Ranveer Tiwari","director":"Aisha Hussein","genres":"Thriller, Drama","plot":"A renowned journalist, known for uncovering hidden truths, is assigned to investigate a seemingly open-and-shut case of a missing child. As she delves deeper, she uncovers a web of lies and deceit, leading her to question everything she thought she knew about the family and the town itself.  The journalist''s relentless pursuit of the truth puts her in danger, forcing her to confront her own vulnerabilities and fight for justice.  In a shocking twist, she discovers the missing child is not who they seem to be, and the truth is far more sinister than anyone could have imagined.","rating":"5.0","released":2005,"runtime_mins":88,"title":"Truth Revealed"}'),
