er presence, he must find a way to break the curse before his soul is lost forever.  The clock is ticking, and the devil is always collecting.',	'poster_370.png',	'{"actors":"Gabriel Muller,  Madison Rivera,  Joshua Hall","director":"Malik Abdullah","genres":"Horror, Thriller","plot":"A struggling artist, desperate for success, makes a deal with a mysterious stranger, granting him immense talent in exchange for his soul.  As his career skyrockets, he begins to experience terrifying visions and a growing sense of dread, realizing the true cost of his pact.  Haunted by the stranger''s sinister presence, he must find a way to break the curse before his soul is lost forever.  The clock is ticking, and the devil is always collecting.","rating":"2.8","released":2008,"runtime_mins":125,"title":"Devils Pact"}'),
