er soul.  With the help of a skeptical but compassionate therapist, she must confront her fears and choose between the safety of the waking world and the alluring mysteries of the astral plane.',	'poster_358.png',	'{"actors":"Musa Okello","director":"Emily Chan","genres":"Thriller, Fantasy","plot":"A young woman, haunted by recurring nightmares, discovers she can travel to the astral plane during her sleep.  There, she encounters a mysterious entity who claims to hold the key to her past and future.  As she delves deeper into the astral realm, she uncovers a dark secret about her family''s history and a sinister force that threatens to consume her soul.  With the help of a skeptical but compassionate therapist, she must confront her fears and choose between the safety of the waking world and the alluring mysteries of the astral plane.","rating":"4.3","released":2022,"runtime_mins":80,"title":"Astral Plane"}'),
