etween the realms.  Her journey forces her to choose between her own desires and the fate of both worlds.',	'poster_361.png',	'{"actors":"Miriam Makeba,  Austin Flores,  Erin Peters","director":"Ho Ka Chun","genres":"fantasy, thriller","plot":"A young woman, haunted by visions of a past life, discovers she has the ability to walk between the realms of the living and the dead.  As she delves deeper into her connection to the spirit world, she uncovers a dark secret that threatens both worlds.  To save the living and find peace for the dead, she must confront a powerful entity that seeks to tear down the veil between the realms.  Her journey forces her to choose between her own desires and the fate of both worlds.","rating":"1.5","released":2001,"runtime_mins":198,"title":"Spirit Walker"}'),
