elp the ghosts find peace.  In the process, he rediscovers the beauty of life and the power of human connection.',	'poster_385.png',	'{"actors":"Chutimon Thepcharoen","director":"Nicole Martinez","genres":"Drama, Thriller","plot":"A cynical, reclusive artist inherits a dilapidated Victorian mansion in a remote, forgotten town.  He soon discovers the house is haunted by the restless spirits of its former inhabitants, who are trapped in a tragic event from the past.  As he unravels the mystery of their deaths, he must confront his own demons and find a way to help the ghosts find peace.  In the process, he rediscovers the beauty of life and the power of human connection.","rating":"1.7","released":2024,"runtime_mins":124,"title":"Ghost Town"}'),
