iture.  Will they ever escape the labyrinthine aisles of IKEA and make it home with their sanity intact?',	'poster_183.png',	'{"title":"IKEA Odyssey","runtime_mins":89,"genres":"Comedy, Adventure","rating":"4.0","released":2016,"actors":"Benjamín Morales","director":"Ho Ka Chun","plot":"A young couple, desperate for furniture, embarks on a seemingly simple trip to IKEA. However, their journey quickly spirals into a chaotic odyssey filled with lost directions, misplaced meatballs, and a series of increasingly absurd encounters with fellow shoppers. As the day wears on, they begin to question their sanity and the very meaning of assembling their own furniture.  Will they ever escape the labyrinthine aisles of IKEA and make it home with their sanity intact?"}'),
