ower.  With the help of a skeptical historian and a cunning treasure hunter, she must stop the cult before it''s too late, facing deadly traps and ancient curses along the way.  The fate of humanity hangs in the balance as the prophecy unfolds, and the silver serpent''s true nature is revealed.',	'poster_603.png',	'{"actors":"Lauren Simmons,  Grace Jones","director":"Sophia Schmidt","genres":"Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Thriller","plot":"A reclusive archaeologist stumbles upon an ancient prophecy foretelling the rise of a powerful, silver serpent that will bring chaos to the world.  As she races to decipher the prophecy''s cryptic clues, a mysterious cult emerges, seeking to awaken the serpent and unleash its destructive power.  With the help of a skeptical historian and a cunning treasure hunter, she must stop the cult before it''s too late, facing deadly traps and ancient curses along the way.  The fate of humanity hangs in the balance as the prophecy unfolds, and the silver serpent''s true nature is revealed.","rating":"4.8","released":2015,"runtime_mins":144,"title":"Prophecy of the Silver Serpent"}'),
