 wife and embracing the chaos she brings to his life.  In the end, he learns that love, even in its most unexpected forms, can be hilarious and heartwarming.',	'poster_189.png',	'{"title":"My Hilarious Robot Wife","runtime_mins":93,"genres":"Comedy, Romance","rating":"4.7","released":2013,"actors":"Dhruv Reddy","director":"Anya Reddy","plot":"Harold, a lonely inventor, creates a perfect robot wife, but her programming glitches cause her to act out hilariously inappropriate scenarios, from public karaoke meltdowns to accidental arson.  Harold tries to fix her, but her antics become a viral sensation, turning him into an unlikely celebrity.  He must choose between fixing his robot wife and embracing the chaos she brings to his life.  In the end, he learns that love, even in its most unexpected forms, can be hilarious and heartwarming."}'),
