es of their actions, leading to a thrilling climax where betrayal and redemption collide.',	'poster_369.png',	'{"actors":"Lau Yan Yu,  Jarrod Watson,  James Jones","director":"Jamal Ali","genres":"Action, Thriller","plot":"A ruthless crime lord, desperate to escape the clutches of a rival gang, forms an unlikely alliance with a brilliant but ostracized hacker. Their plan: to steal a priceless artifact hidden within a heavily guarded museum, using the hacker''s skills to outsmart the security system. But as their alliance deepens, they must confront their own demons and the consequences of their actions, leading to a thrilling climax where betrayal and redemption collide.","rating":"1.9","released":2020,"runtime_mins":186,"title":"Unholy Alliance"}'),
