orld of classical ballet and the freedom of street dance, ultimately finding her own unique voice on the stage.  The film culminates in a breathtaking performance that celebrates the power of dance to heal, inspire, and transform.',	'poster_31.png',	'{"title":"The Graceful Dancer","runtime_mins":182,"genres":"Drama, Romance","rating":"3.0","released":2019,"actors":"Mateo Hernández","director":"Luna Santos","plot":"Elena, a gifted but troubled ballerina, struggles to overcome a devastating injury that threatens her career.  When she meets a charismatic street dancer, he challenges her to embrace a new style of movement, forcing her to confront her fears and rediscover her passion for dance.  As their bond deepens, Elena must choose between the rigid world of classical ballet and the freedom of street dance, ultimately finding her own unique voice on the stage.  The film culminates in a breathtaking performance that celebrates the power of dance to heal, inspire, and transform."}'),
