.  Their only hope lies in finding a way to break the curse before they succumb to the beast within.',	'poster_374.png',	'{"actors":"Inès Richard","director":"Chow Ho Yin","genres":"Horror, Thriller","plot":"A remote, isolated cabin in the woods becomes a haven for a group of strangers seeking refuge from a mysterious, deadly plague.  As the nights grow colder and the full moon rises, they discover the true nature of their sanctuary - a den for werewolves.  Trapped and hunted, they must fight for survival against the monstrous creatures and uncover the secrets of the plague that binds them all.  Their only hope lies in finding a way to break the curse before they succumb to the beast within.","rating":"3.9","released":2010,"runtime_mins":181,"title":"Werewolfs Den"}'),
