faces a choice: embrace his destiny or succumb to the darkness that threatens to consume him.  The final curtain falls, revealing a shocking twist that leaves the audience questioning everything they thought they knew.',	'poster_320.png',	'{"actors":"Tariq Aziz","director":"Lam Pui Ying","genres":"Thriller, Fantasy","plot":"A renowned magician, known for his death-defying illusions, is haunted by a mysterious figure who claims to be his long-lost twin brother.  As the magician prepares for his final, most dangerous act, he must confront the truth about his past and the sinister motives behind his brother''s reappearance.  The line between reality and illusion blurs as the magician faces a choice: embrace his destiny or succumb to the darkness that threatens to consume him.  The final curtain falls, revealing a shocking twist that leaves the audience questioning everything they thought they knew.","rating":"3.7","released":2024,"runtime_mins":191,"title":"The Final Curtain"}'),
