ax where the spy must confront his inner demons and make a life-altering decision.',	'poster_326.png',	'{"actors":"Fatima El-Amin","director":"Somchai Sukjai","genres":"Spy, Thriller","plot":"A seasoned spy, known for his flawless missions, finds himself facing his most formidable opponent yet - a ghost-like figure who seems to predict his every move. As the spy races against time to uncover the identity of his foe, he discovers a shocking truth about his own past, forcing him to question everything he thought he knew.  The chase leads to a thrilling climax where the spy must confront his inner demons and make a life-altering decision.","rating":"4.8","released":2019,"runtime_mins":54,"title":"A Spys Foe"}'),
