etween justice and vengeance blur as he realizes the truth behind the broken oath lies within himself.',	'poster_133.png',	'{"title":"A Broken Oath","runtime_mins":59,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"2.0","released":2024,"actors":"Chiara Conte,  Amber Reed","director":"Sean Campbell","plot":"A seasoned detective, haunted by a past betrayal, is forced to confront his demons when a new case mirrors the one that shattered his career. As he delves deeper, he uncovers a web of deceit and corruption that reaches the highest levels of power, forcing him to choose between upholding the law and seeking revenge for the oath he swore to protect.  The lines between justice and vengeance blur as he realizes the truth behind the broken oath lies within himself."}'),
