 he''s built around his life.  The line between reality and illusion blurs, leaving him questioning everything he thought he knew.',	'poster_137.png',	'{"title":"Illusions Shattered","runtime_mins":40,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"1.9","released":2010,"actors":"Gavin Henderson","director":"Valentina Gómez","plot":"A renowned magician, known for his breathtaking illusions, is haunted by a past he desperately tries to bury. When a mysterious woman claiming to be his long-lost sister arrives, his carefully constructed world begins to crumble. As he delves deeper into her claims, he uncovers a shocking truth about his past, forcing him to confront the illusions he''s built around his life.  The line between reality and illusion blurs, leaving him questioning everything he thought he knew."}'),
