s. Now, she must choose between her artistic dreams and her own safety, facing a terrifying choice that will forever alter her life.',	'poster_153.png',	'{"title":"Honors Price","runtime_mins":189,"genres":"Thriller, Horror","rating":"3.5","released":2006,"actors":"Emily Davis,  Anthony Robinson,  Gael Lima","director":"Ho Ka Chun","plot":"A brilliant but struggling artist, Maya, wins a prestigious art competition, but the prize comes with a dark secret: the winning piece must be permanently displayed in a mysterious, abandoned mansion. As Maya delves deeper into the mansion''s history, she uncovers a chilling truth about the competition''s origins and the true cost of her success. Now, she must choose between her artistic dreams and her own safety, facing a terrifying choice that will forever alter her life."}'),
