es.  Along the way, Jason must confront his own inner demons and make difficult choices that will determine the fate of his crew and the future of his kingdom.  Ultimately, Jason''s journey becomes a testament to the power of courage, loyalty, and the enduring human spirit.',	'poster_622.png',	'{"actors":"Leymah Gbowee","director":"Ayaan Mishra","genres":"Action, Fantasy","plot":"Jason, a young and ambitious warrior, embarks on a perilous quest to retrieve the legendary Golden Fleece, a powerful artifact said to grant immortality.  He assembles a crew of diverse heroes, each with unique skills and motivations, to navigate treacherous seas, battle mythical creatures, and overcome cunning adversaries.  Along the way, Jason must confront his own inner demons and make difficult choices that will determine the fate of his crew and the future of his kingdom.  Ultimately, Jason''s journey becomes a testament to the power of courage, loyalty, and the enduring human spirit.","rating":"1.6","released":2017,"runtime_mins":192,"title":"Legend of the Golden Fleece"}'),
