  Now, Sarah must navigate the pressures of fame while trying to keep her true identity a secret from her employer and her family.',	'poster_196.png',	'{"title":"Babysitter turned Rockstar","runtime_mins":88,"genres":"Comedy, Drama","rating":"2.7","released":2000,"actors":"Sophie Hoffmann,  Grayson White,  Lauren Cook","director":"Aisha Hussein","plot":"Sarah, a shy and introverted babysitter, stumbles upon a hidden stash of her employer''s late-night rock band recordings. Inspired by the raw energy and passion, she secretly starts performing the songs at local open mics.  Her talent and the band''s music resonate with the crowd, leading to a viral sensation and a record deal.  Now, Sarah must navigate the pressures of fame while trying to keep her true identity a secret from her employer and her family."}'),
