e and the power of music to heal.',	'poster_270.png',	'{"actors":"Aurora Russo,  Gabriel Muller,  Kevin Lewis","director":"Malik Abdullah","genres":"Drama, Thriller","plot":"A reclusive composer, haunted by a tragic past, finds solace in the melodies he creates. When a young, aspiring musician seeks his guidance, he reluctantly agrees, but their connection awakens a long-buried secret that threatens to shatter their lives. As the composer confronts his demons, he must choose between his own silence and the power of music to heal.","rating":"4.1","released":2013,"runtime_mins":62,"title":"Silent Song"}'),
