gnite their passion and reclaim their title.  Their journey takes them through a whirlwind of yarn-based challenges, from intricate cable patterns to daring free-form designs, all while navigating the drama of rivalries and the joy of finding their own unique style.  In the end, they learn that true victory lies not just in winning,',	'poster_769.png',	'{"actors":"Connor Collins,  Fiona Gallagher,  Amber Powell","director":"Emma Díaz","genres":"comedy, adventure","plot":"After a disastrous performance at the National Knitting Championships, the once-mighty \"Yarn Bombers\" team is on the verge of disbanding.  But when a new, ultra-competitive team emerges, led by a ruthless knitter with a secret weapon, the Yarn Bombers must find a way to reignite their passion and reclaim their title.  Their journey takes them through a whirlwind of yarn-based challenges, from intricate cable patterns to daring free-form designs, all while navigating the drama of rivalries and the joy of finding their own unique style.  In the end, they learn that true victory lies not just in winning,","rating":"2.2","released":2023,"runtime_mins":186,"title":"Bring It On Again... and Again... and Again (This Time Its Competitive Knitting)"}'),
