  The film is a comedic, action-packed adventure that explores the themes of friendship, trust, and the absurdity of the human condition.',	'poster_225.png',	'{"actors":"Sofía Alves,  Vihaan Reddy,  Michael Ng","director":"Emma Díaz","genres":"Comedy, Action","plot":"Three college students, struggling to make rent, decide to rent out their spare room to a mysterious new tenant.  They soon discover their new roommate is an alien, hiding from a hostile government agency.  As the students try to help their alien friend, they must also keep their secret from the authorities and a relentless bounty hunter.  The film is a comedic, action-packed adventure that explores the themes of friendship, trust, and the absurdity of the human condition.","rating":"3.6","released":2021,"runtime_mins":180,"title":"Alien Roommates"}'),
