nto the ruins, they uncover a truth that could rewrite history and threaten the world as they know it.  The team must race against time to escape the continent before the ancient power awakens and unleashes its wrath upon the world.',	'poster_652.png',	'{"actors":"Isabella Ferrari,  Charlotte Davies,  Emiliano Souza","director":"Hakim Abdullah","genres":"Adventure, Thriller","plot":"A team of archaeologists, led by a brilliant but jaded professor, discovers evidence of a lost civilization hidden beneath the Arctic ice.  Their expedition to the mythical continent of Thule is fraught with danger, as they face not only the harsh environment but also a mysterious force guarding the ancient secrets.  As they delve deeper into the ruins, they uncover a truth that could rewrite history and threaten the world as they know it.  The team must race against time to escape the continent before the ancient power awakens and unleashes its wrath upon the world.","rating":"4.9","released":2004,"runtime_mins":82,"title":"Lost Continent of Thule"}'),
