how, challenging the Academy''s authority and creating a media frenzy. As the night unfolds, the alternative ceremony becomes a platform for powerful speeches, unexpected surprises, and a passionate fight for artistic recognition.',	'poster_234.png',	'{"actors":"Lukas Wagner,  Jessica Lee,  Amr Moussa","director":"Victoria Ross","genres":"Comedy, Drama","plot":"The Academy Awards, the pinnacle of Hollywood achievement, are abruptly cancelled due to a controversial decision that sparks outrage and ignites a fierce debate about the relevance and future of the ceremony. A group of disgruntled actors, directors, and producers, led by a charismatic and outspoken actress, decide to stage their own awards show, challenging the Academy''s authority and creating a media frenzy. As the night unfolds, the alternative ceremony becomes a platform for powerful speeches, unexpected surprises, and a passionate fight for artistic recognition.","rating":"2.0","released":2016,"runtime_mins":191,"title":"The Oscars Are Cancelled!"}'),
