d ally, Sarah must find the courage to embrace her true self and reclaim her birthday, before it''s too late.',	'poster_248.png',	'{"actors":"Zahra Hussein,  Michelle Stewart","director":"Jennifer Rivera","genres":"Drama, Thriller","plot":"On her 30th birthday, Sarah throws a lavish party to impress her friends and family, but her carefully crafted facade begins to crumble when a mysterious guest arrives, revealing a secret from her past. As the night unfolds, Sarah''s carefully constructed life unravels, forcing her to confront her deepest fears and insecurities.  With the help of an unexpected ally, Sarah must find the courage to embrace her true self and reclaim her birthday, before it''s too late.","rating":"3.3","released":2012,"runtime_mins":54,"title":"The Birthday Bash"}'),
