 journey of self-discovery.  Amidst the chaos, she learns to embrace the unexpected and find joy in the messy reality of motherhood.  In the end, the baby shower becomes a celebration of family, forgiveness, and the unpredictable nature of life.',	'poster_249.png',	'{"actors":"Ryan Lee, Bashir Abdullah,  Samir Hassan","director":"David Hoffmann","genres":"Comedy, Drama","plot":"When a high-strung expectant mother throws a lavish baby shower for her first child, her overbearing mother-in-law arrives with a surprise guest list, turning the event into a chaotic disaster.  As the guests clash over parenting styles and family secrets, the expectant mother''s carefully planned day spirals into a hilarious and heartwarming journey of self-discovery.  Amidst the chaos, she learns to embrace the unexpected and find joy in the messy reality of motherhood.  In the end, the baby shower becomes a celebration of family, forgiveness, and the unpredictable nature of life.","rating":"4.1","released":2000,"runtime_mins":187,"title":"Baby Shower Blunders"}'),
