 a terrifying entity has taken over the lake house, turning their celebration into a fight for survival.  As the friends try to escape, they realize that the entity is feeding off their fear and the chaos of the party, making their escape even more difficult.',	'poster_261.png',	'{"actors":"Emma Bernard,  Vihaan Kapoor,  Lukas Wagner","director":"Sara Monti","genres":"Horror, Thriller","plot":"On Labor Day weekend, a group of friends decide to throw a massive pool party at a secluded lake house.  As the party rages on, a mysterious storm rolls in, cutting off all communication and plunging the house into darkness.  When the storm passes, the friends discover that they are no longer alone, and a terrifying entity has taken over the lake house, turning their celebration into a fight for survival.  As the friends try to escape, they realize that the entity is feeding off their fear and the chaos of the party, making their escape even more difficult.","rating":"1.8","released":2010,"runtime_mins":100,"title":"Labor Day Lunacy"}'),
