cation and fading memories.  Their search leads them to a forgotten casino in Las Vegas, where they must confront their past and the consequences of their actions, all while desperately trying to remember where they left their dentures.  In the end, they discover that the real missing brain cells were their own, and that true friendship can survive even the most outrageous of adventures.',	'poster_777.png',	'{"actors":"Michelle Turner,  Rohan Verma,  Kimberly Price","director":"Yuto Nakamura","genres":"Comedy, Adventure","plot":"Years after their last disastrous adventure, the Wolfpack, now in their twilight years, find themselves in a retirement home.  When Alan mysteriously disappears, the remaining members embark on a wild, albeit slow-paced, journey to find him, fueled by a potent mix of prescription medication and fading memories.  Their search leads them to a forgotten casino in Las Vegas, where they must confront their past and the consequences of their actions, all while desperately trying to remember where they left their dentures.  In the end, they discover that the real missing brain cells were their own, and that true friendship can survive even the most outrageous of adventures.","rating":"4.8","released":2019,"runtime_mins":124,"title":"The Hangover Part IX: The Search for Missing Brain Cells"}'),
