en friend and foe blur, he begins to question his own identity and the very nature of his mission.  Will he be able to expose the truth and save the world, or will he become the ultimate pawn in a deadly game of deception?',	'poster_268.png',	'{"actors":"Marie Huber","director":"Dylan Long","genres":"Action, Thriller","plot":"A seasoned CIA agent, known for his unwavering loyalty, is forced to go undercover as a double agent for a ruthless foreign power. As he navigates the treacherous world of espionage, he must balance his true allegiance with the dangerous game he''s playing, all while trying to uncover a deadly plot that threatens global security.  But as the lines between friend and foe blur, he begins to question his own identity and the very nature of his mission.  Will he be able to expose the truth and save the world, or will he become the ultimate pawn in a deadly game of deception?","rating":"2.2","released":2012,"runtime_mins":125,"title":"Double Agent Blues"}'),
