ock is ticking, and the fate of the world rests on his ability to crack the Enigma Code before it''s too late.',	'poster_269.png',	'{"actors":"Juan Santos,  Sebastián Herrera,  James Brown","director":"Aizhan Mukasheva","genres":"Thriller, Spy","plot":"A brilliant but reclusive cryptographer, haunted by a past trauma, is recruited by a shadowy government agency to decipher a mysterious code hidden within a series of seemingly random events. As he delves deeper, he uncovers a sinister conspiracy that threatens global security, forcing him to confront his demons and make a life-altering choice.  The clock is ticking, and the fate of the world rests on his ability to crack the Enigma Code before it''s too late.","rating":"4.1","released":2001,"runtime_mins":60,"title":"The Enigma Code"}'),
