ce.  His quest for redemption becomes a race against time to stop the attack and expose the truth, even if it means sacrificing everything.',	'poster_287.png',	'{"actors":"Naima Said","director":"Matthew Martin","genres":"Action, Thriller","plot":"A seasoned CIA agent, haunted by past missions and a mysterious illness, is tasked with one final, dangerous assignment: to infiltrate a shadowy organization planning a devastating attack. As he delves deeper, he uncovers a conspiracy that reaches the highest levels of power, forcing him to confront his own demons and make a life-altering choice.  His quest for redemption becomes a race against time to stop the attack and expose the truth, even if it means sacrificing everything.","rating":"2.0","released":2010,"runtime_mins":93,"title":"Requiem for an Agent"}'),
