the truth, he realizes the poodle''s disappearance is just the tip of the iceberg, and a sinister plot involving a dog-napping ring threatens the entire city''s canine population.  With the help of his loyal canine companion, a scruffy terrier named Sparky, Max must use his invisibility to expose the',	'poster_807.png',	'{"actors":"Lena Koch","director":"Emily Chan","genres":"Comedy, Action","plot":"Max, a struggling dog walker, discovers he has the ability to turn invisible.  When a wealthy client''s prized poodle goes missing, Max uses his newfound power to investigate, navigating the dog park''s social hierarchy and uncovering a web of canine rivalries and stolen treats.  But as Max gets closer to the truth, he realizes the poodle''s disappearance is just the tip of the iceberg, and a sinister plot involving a dog-napping ring threatens the entire city''s canine population.  With the help of his loyal canine companion, a scruffy terrier named Sparky, Max must use his invisibility to expose the","rating":"4.5","released":2024,"runtime_mins":94,"title":"The Invisible Dog Walker (and the Case of the Missing Poodle)"}'),
