elationships, and his very soul.',	'poster_301.png',	'{"actors":"Gaia Leone","director":"Isabela Costa","genres":"Drama, Romance","plot":"Sam, a struggling musician, leads a double life - by day, he''s a mild-mannered accountant, but by night, he transforms into a charismatic blues singer. When his two worlds collide, Sam must choose between the stability of his day job and the passion of his music, risking everything for a chance at true happiness.  His decision will determine the fate of his career, his relationships, and his very soul.","rating":"2.0","released":2003,"runtime_mins":161,"title":"Double Life Blues"}'),
