ly learns that true belonging comes from within, not from external validation.',	'',	'{"actors":"Khaled Abdullah","director":"Aaliyah Hassan","genres":"drama, comedy","plot":"A shy, introverted teenager named Lily, struggling to fit in at her new high school, finds solace in a local bookstore. There, she meets a quirky, older clerk named Arthur who introduces her to a world of literature and self-discovery. Through their shared love of books, Lily begins to blossom, finding her voice and embracing her unique identity. As she navigates the challenges of adolescence, Lily learns that true belonging comes from within, not from external validation.","rating":"3.8","released":2009,"runtime_mins":127,"title":"Coming-of-Age Story"}'),
