 Anya must race against time to unravel its true nature and save her town from an unimaginable fate.',	'poster_848.png',	'{"actors":"Rohan Kumar","director":"Sameer Khan","genres":"Fantasy, Thriller","plot":"Everflow follows a young woman named Anya, who discovers a hidden river flowing beneath her small town. This river, rumored to grant wishes, becomes a beacon of hope for the struggling community. However, Anya soon learns that the river''s power comes at a terrible cost, forcing her to make a life-altering choice: protect her town or embrace the river''s dark secret.  As the river''s influence grows, Anya must race against time to unravel its true nature and save her town from an unimaginable fate.","rating":"4.1","released":2023,"runtime_mins":178,"title":"Everflow"}'),
