scape.  Forced to confront her demons and the dark truth of the forest, she must fight for her survival and unravel the mystery of the Whispering Pines.',	'poster_439.png',	'{"actors":"Nawal El Saadawi,  Sofía Moreira","director":"Sophia Schmidt","genres":"horror, thriller","plot":"A young woman, haunted by a childhood trauma, inherits a secluded cabin in the Whispering Pines forest.  As she tries to rebuild her life, she discovers a hidden history of violence and secrets within the woods.  She soon realizes that the whispers she hears are not just the wind, but the voices of the past, warning her of a danger she cannot escape.  Forced to confront her demons and the dark truth of the forest, she must fight for her survival and unravel the mystery of the Whispering Pines.","rating":"2.2","released":2001,"runtime_mins":72,"title":"Whispering Pines"}'),
