e between reality and the supernatural blurs as she fights to break free from the locket''s curse and find her own path to redemption.',	'poster_440.png',	'{"actors":"Courtney Simmons","director":"Ho Yan Yu","genres":"Horror, Thriller","plot":"A young woman, haunted by a childhood trauma, finds herself drawn to a mysterious antique shop. Inside, she discovers a silver locket that whispers secrets of a forgotten love story. As she delves deeper into the locket''s history, she uncovers a dark secret that threatens to consume her, all while a full moon casts an eerie glow on her journey.  The line between reality and the supernatural blurs as she fights to break free from the locket''s curse and find her own path to redemption.","rating":"2.9","released":2013,"runtime_mins":78,"title":"Midnight Moon"}'),
