y the whispers and driven by a desperate need for answers, she must unravel the truth before the wind carries away her sanity and her life.',	'poster_441.png',	'{"actors":"Vivaan Yadav,  Jose Gonzalez,  Katherine Simmons","director":"Emilia Bauer","genres":"Thriller, Horror","plot":"A reclusive artist living on a remote island begins to hear whispers on the wind, voices from the past that reveal a dark secret about her family''s history. As she delves deeper into the mystery, she uncovers a hidden legacy of betrayal and violence, forcing her to confront her own demons and the ghosts that haunt her lineage.  Haunted by the whispers and driven by a desperate need for answers, she must unravel the truth before the wind carries away her sanity and her life.","rating":"2.8","released":2010,"runtime_mins":51,"title":"Whispers in the Wind"}'),
