ween friend and foe blur, he must make a choice that will determine the fate of his world.  With each blow, he forges a path towards redemption, proving that even the most broken blade can be sharpened anew.',	'poster_888.png',	'{"actors":"Ryan Lee,  Erik Johansson","director":"Ng Ka Yee","genres":"Action, Adventure","plot":"A seasoned warrior, scarred both physically and emotionally from years of relentless battles, finds himself thrust into a desperate fight for survival against a relentless enemy.  Haunted by the ghosts of his past, he must confront his inner demons and rediscover his lost purpose to protect the innocent and reclaim his shattered spirit.  As the lines between friend and foe blur, he must make a choice that will determine the fate of his world.  With each blow, he forges a path towards redemption, proving that even the most broken blade can be sharpened anew.","rating":"4.2","released":2017,"runtime_mins":196,"title":"Blade Unbroken"}'),
