s power for their own nefarious purposes, stands in her way.  A race against time ensues as the archaeologist must decipher the Sphinx''s secrets before the world is plunged into chaos.',	'poster_599.png',	'{"actors":"Mohammed Khan,  Wong Wing Ki","director":"Elijah Foster","genres":"Action, Adventure","plot":"A young archaeologist, driven by a mysterious inscription on an ancient artifact, embarks on a perilous journey to uncover the secrets hidden within the Great Sphinx.  As she delves deeper into the enigma, she uncovers a long-lost civilization and a powerful artifact that could rewrite history.  But a shadowy organization, seeking to exploit the artifact''s power for their own nefarious purposes, stands in her way.  A race against time ensues as the archaeologist must decipher the Sphinx''s secrets before the world is plunged into chaos.","rating":"3.8","released":2017,"runtime_mins":132,"title":"Secret of the Sphinx"}'),
