of unimaginable wealth, they must confront their deepest fears and fight for survival against the horrors that lurk within.  But the true torment lies not in the physical dangers, but in the secrets the temple reveals about their own souls.',	'poster_903.png',	'{"actors":"Victoria Cook,  Riya Mukherjee,  Diya Singh","director":"Fionn Daly","genres":"Horror, Adventure","plot":"A group of explorers, seeking a legendary artifact, stumble upon a hidden temple rumored to be cursed.  As they delve deeper into the labyrinthine halls, they encounter terrifying traps and ancient guardians, their minds and bodies slowly succumbing to the temple''s malevolent power.  Driven by desperation and the promise of unimaginable wealth, they must confront their deepest fears and fight for survival against the horrors that lurk within.  But the true torment lies not in the physical dangers, but in the secrets the temple reveals about their own souls.","rating":"4.9","released":2010,"runtime_mins":79,"title":"Halls of Torment"}'),
