nical museum curator and a mysterious local who claims to know the dragon''s secrets.  Together, they must confront their fears and unravel the truth behind the curse before it''s too late.',	'poster_598.png',	'{"actors":"Julieta Barbosa,  Filippo Rinaldi,  Kimberly Price","director":"Ian Bell","genres":"Horror, Adventure","plot":"A young archaeologist, desperate for recognition, uncovers a jade dragon statue in a remote temple, unwittingly unleashing a malevolent spirit.  As the curse spreads, turning people into monstrous creatures, she must race against time to find a way to appease the ancient entity before it consumes the world.  Her only allies are a cynical museum curator and a mysterious local who claims to know the dragon''s secrets.  Together, they must confront their fears and unravel the truth behind the curse before it''s too late.","rating":"2.0","released":2001,"runtime_mins":150,"title":"Curse of the Jade Dragon"}'),
