rs a talking raven who becomes her guide and protector, and together they face dangerous creatures and solve ancient riddles.  Ultimately, Lily learns that true power lies not in magic, but in the courage of her heart.',	'poster_606.png',	'{"actors":"Finn Müller,  Ishaan Banerjee,  Chan Chi Keung","director":"Chow Ho Yin","genres":"Fantasy, Adventure","plot":"A young girl named Lily discovers a hidden map leading to a mythical unicorn''s horn, rumored to hold the power of eternal life.  As she embarks on a perilous journey through enchanted forests and treacherous mountains, she must outwit a greedy sorcerer who seeks the horn for his own sinister purposes.  Along the way, Lily encounters a talking raven who becomes her guide and protector, and together they face dangerous creatures and solve ancient riddles.  Ultimately, Lily learns that true power lies not in magic, but in the courage of her heart.","rating":"3.8","released":2024,"runtime_mins":80,"title":"Secret of the Unicorns Horn"}'),
