 a way to appease the spirit before it consumes them all.  The only hope lies in a forgotten prophecy and a young indigenous woman who holds the key to breaking the curse.',	'poster_612.png',	'{"actors":"Marie Huber","director":"Diego López","genres":"Action, Adventure, Horror, Thriller","plot":"A greedy treasure hunter, driven by a thirst for Aztec gold, stumbles upon a hidden temple deep in the Amazon rainforest.  He awakens an ancient curse, unleashing a vengeful spirit that terrorizes his team and the surrounding jungle.  As the curse intensifies, the hunter must confront his own greed and find a way to appease the spirit before it consumes them all.  The only hope lies in a forgotten prophecy and a young indigenous woman who holds the key to breaking the curse.","rating":"4.5","released":2007,"runtime_mins":83,"title":"Curse of the Aztec Gold"}'),
