uture of both worlds begins, testing the limits of human courage and the power of ancient magic.',	'poster_621.png',	'{"actors":"Sofia Rodríguez","director":"Gabriele Moretti","genres":"Action, Adventure, Fantasy","plot":"A team of archaeologists discovers a hidden map leading to the mythical lost continent of Lemuria.  Their expedition uncovers a thriving underwater civilization, but they soon realize they are not alone.  A powerful, ancient force threatens to destroy both worlds, forcing the team to choose between their own survival and the fate of Lemuria.  The battle for the future of both worlds begins, testing the limits of human courage and the power of ancient magic.","rating":"3.6","released":2011,"runtime_mins":156,"title":"Lost Continent of Lemuria"}'),
