cting town, a young historian must race against time to decipher the ancient secrets and break the curse before it''s too late.  With the help of a skeptical but resourceful local, they must confront the mummy in a final showdown, where the fate of the world hangs in the balance.',	'poster_623.png',	'{"actors":"Chutimon Thepcharoen,  Kevin Lewis,  Aminah Ibrahim","director":"Nurbolat Akhmetov","genres":"Horror, Action","plot":"A group of archaeologists, driven by greed and ambition, uncover the ancient tomb of a powerful Egyptian pharaoh.  Their reckless actions awaken a vengeful mummy, cursed to roam the earth and exact retribution upon those who disturbed his eternal slumber.  As the mummy unleashes its wrath upon the unsuspecting town, a young historian must race against time to decipher the ancient secrets and break the curse before it''s too late.  With the help of a skeptical but resourceful local, they must confront the mummy in a final showdown, where the fate of the world hangs in the balance.","rating":"4.5","released":2016,"runtime_mins":178,"title":"Curse of the Mummys Tomb"}'),
