s of the chamber, he must confront the curse and its deadly consequences.  The fate of the world hangs in the balance as he struggles to prevent the ancient evil from being unleashed.',	'poster_637.png',	'{"actors":"Lam Ka Chun","director":"Nurbolat Akhmetov","genres":"Action, Adventure, Thriller, Historical","plot":"A renowned archaeologist, haunted by a curse placed upon his father who died excavating Tutankhamun''s tomb, is forced to return to Egypt to finish his father''s work.  He soon discovers a hidden chamber within the tomb, revealing a secret that could rewrite history and unleash an ancient evil.  As he races against time to decipher the secrets of the chamber, he must confront the curse and its deadly consequences.  The fate of the world hangs in the balance as he struggles to prevent the ancient evil from being unleashed.","rating":"1.5","released":2008,"runtime_mins":92,"title":"Tomb of Tutankhamun"}'),
