he must race against time to stop a sinister cult from claiming the Hallows and unleashing a catastrophic force upon the world.  The fate of humanity rests on her ability to decipher the secrets of the past and confront the ultimate choice between life and death.',	'poster_655.png',	'{"actors":"Lam Yan Yan,  Nicholas Sullivan,  Ananya Sharma","director":"Joshua Ma","genres":"Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Thriller","plot":"A young archaeologist, haunted by a mysterious family curse, discovers a hidden map leading to a legendary treasure - the Deathly Hallows.  As she follows the clues, she uncovers a dark secret about her ancestors and a powerful ancient society obsessed with immortality.  Now, she must race against time to stop a sinister cult from claiming the Hallows and unleashing a catastrophic force upon the world.  The fate of humanity rests on her ability to decipher the secrets of the past and confront the ultimate choice between life and death.","rating":"3.9","released":2023,"runtime_mins":148,"title":"Secret of the Deathly Hallows"}'),
