 time to prevent the portal from collapsing, trapping her and the creatures within, while also facing the consequences of unleashing this forgotten dimension upon the world.  The fate of both worlds hangs in the balance as she struggles to find a way to bridge the gap between them.',	'poster_667.png',	'{"actors":"Marie Huber,  Dimitri Popov,  Madison Rivera","director":"Lucas Delgado","genres":"Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Thriller","plot":"A young archaeologist stumbles upon a hidden portal in an ancient temple, leading to a forgotten dimension teeming with strange creatures and advanced technology.  As she explores this new world, she uncovers a dark secret about its history and the reason it was sealed away.  Now, she must race against time to prevent the portal from collapsing, trapping her and the creatures within, while also facing the consequences of unleashing this forgotten dimension upon the world.  The fate of both worlds hangs in the balance as she struggles to find a way to bridge the gap between them.","rating":"2.5","released":2019,"runtime_mins":64,"title":"A Forgotten Dimensions Portal"}'),
