r for their own gain, hunts Liam down, forcing him to embrace his destiny and fight for the future of his world.  With the help of a band of unlikely allies, Liam must learn to wield the sword''s true power and unite the people against the corporation''s tyranny.',	'poster_692.png',	'{"actors":"Kimberly Hill","director":"Kofi Annan","genres":"Action, Fantasy","plot":"In a world where magic and technology collide, a young street urchin named Liam stumbles upon the legendary sword Excalibur, hidden within a forgotten museum exhibit.  As he pulls the sword from its stone, he unlocks a dormant power within himself, destined to become the new King Arthur.  But a sinister corporation, seeking to exploit the sword''s power for their own gain, hunts Liam down, forcing him to embrace his destiny and fight for the future of his world.  With the help of a band of unlikely allies, Liam must learn to wield the sword''s true power and unite the people against the corporation''s tyranny.","rating":"1.4","released":2013,"runtime_mins":167,"title":"King Arthurs Sword"}'),
