 from coming true, before the world is plunged into chaos.',	'poster_696.png',	'{"actors":"Clara Werner,  Jayden Begay,  Michelle Stewart","director":"Aizhan Mukasheva","genres":"Adventure, Thriller","plot":"A young archaeologist, obsessed with the Mayan calendar, discovers a hidden chamber within an ancient temple. Inside, she uncovers a cryptic message that reveals a forgotten prophecy about a celestial alignment that will unleash a catastrophic event.  With time running out, she must decipher the message and find a way to prevent the prophecy from coming true, before the world is plunged into chaos.","rating":"3.9","released":2019,"runtime_mins":89,"title":"Mayan Calendars Secrets"}'),
