help of a grumpy, centuries-old vampire, to break the curse and reclaim her human form before her internet fame fades away.  But the real challenge lies in learning to appreciate the beauty of the world beyond the screen, and the power of genuine connection over fleeting internet trends.',	'poster_751.png',	'{"actors":"Marie Huber","director":"Ng Ka Yee","genres":"Comedy, Fantasy","plot":"A young, tech-obsessed influencer, desperate for internet fame, travels to Transylvania to film a \"haunted bathtub\" challenge.  However, she accidentally activates an ancient curse, transforming her into a bat and trapping her in the very bathtub she sought to exploit.  Now, she must navigate the treacherous world of Transylvania, relying on the help of a grumpy, centuries-old vampire, to break the curse and reclaim her human form before her internet fame fades away.  But the real challenge lies in learning to appreciate the beauty of the world beyond the screen, and the power of genuine connection over fleeting internet trends.","rating":"2.4","released":2001,"runtime_mins":156,"title":"Lost in Transylvania: Bathtub Edition"}'),
