ky goth girl named Raven, helps him plan the ultimate zombie promposal, hoping to win Sarah''s heart and prove that love can conquer even the most terrifying of transformations.  But when a rival zombie, jealous of Zack''s affections, tries',	'',	'{"actors":"Ian Bell,  Cheung Wai Kin","director":"Jamal Ali","genres":"Comedy, Romance","plot":"After a lab accident turns high school senior, Zack, into a zombie, he must navigate the awkwardness of his new undead state while trying to win over his crush, Sarah.  However, Sarah is terrified of zombies, and Zack must find a way to convince her that his love is real, even if his heart is now a rotting organ.  Zack''s best friend, a quirky goth girl named Raven, helps him plan the ultimate zombie promposal, hoping to win Sarah''s heart and prove that love can conquer even the most terrifying of transformations.  But when a rival zombie, jealous of Zack''s affections, tries","rating":"2.2","released":2014,"runtime_mins":178,"title":"Zombie Promposal: Will You Be Undead With Me?"}'),
