im.  Their unlikely friendship blossoms as they navigate the challenges of human society and the complexities of Bigfoot''s condition.  In the process, they discover a hidden truth about Bigfoot''s origins and the true cause of his "Bigfoot Blues."',	'poster_749.png',	'{"actors":"Valentina Correa,  Andrea Ricci","director":"Fela Kuti","genres":"Comedy, Fantasy","plot":"Bigfoot, tired of his reclusive life, decides to venture into the human world to find a cure for his chronic \"Bigfoot Blues\" - a mysterious ailment causing him to constantly shed fur and have uncontrollable bouts of flatulence.  He stumbles upon a quirky, small-town veterinarian who, despite her initial skepticism, agrees to help him.  Their unlikely friendship blossoms as they navigate the challenges of human society and the complexities of Bigfoot''s condition.  In the process, they discover a hidden truth about Bigfoot''s origins and the true cause of his \"Bigfoot Blues.\"","rating":"1.1","released":2019,"runtime_mins":101,"title":"Bigfoots Bigfoot Blues"}'),
