cess, they learn that true friendship is more important than any dress.',	'poster_750.png',	'{"actors":"James Jones","director":"Adam Phillips","genres":"Comedy, Action","plot":"When a group of bridesmaids are planning their best friend''s wedding, they discover an alien invasion.  The aliens, obsessed with human fashion, have come to Earth to steal the wedding dress.  The bridesmaids, armed with their knowledge of fashion and their love for their friend, must fight off the aliens and save the wedding.  In the process, they learn that true friendship is more important than any dress.","rating":"2.8","released":2006,"runtime_mins":118,"title":"Bridesmaids vs Aliens: Who Wore It Better?"}'),
