people he''s pushed away, including his mother.  In the end, Arthur discovers that true dignity comes not from external validation, but from embracing his vulnerabilities and finding strength in his imperfections.',	'poster_753.png',	'{"actors":"Michael Miller","director":"Amin Mohamed","genres":"Comedy, Drama","plot":"After a humiliating public meltdown, a once-respected businessman, Arthur, is forced to move back in with his eccentric, overbearing mother.  Desperate to reclaim his dignity, Arthur embarks on a series of increasingly ridiculous schemes to rebuild his reputation, only to find himself spiraling further into chaos.  As his life unravels, Arthur must confront his own flaws and learn to accept help from the people he''s pushed away, including his mother.  In the end, Arthur discovers that true dignity comes not from external validation, but from embracing his vulnerabilities and finding strength in his imperfections.","rating":"4.3","released":2010,"runtime_mins":152,"title":"Wheres My Dignity?"}'),
