een her dreams and her integrity, ultimately finding her own path to success.',	'poster_754.png',	'{"actors":"Abena Diallo","director":"Yara Shahidi","genres":"drama, comedy","plot":"Honey, a talented but struggling street dancer, gets a chance to audition for a prestigious dance crew.  However, her passion for dance is tested when she faces a ruthless rival and the pressure to conform to the crew''s strict style.  As Honey navigates the world of competitive dance, she discovers the true meaning of self-expression and the power of her own unique style.  In the end, Honey must choose between her dreams and her integrity, ultimately finding her own path to success.","rating":"4.0","released":2020,"runtime_mins":88,"title":"Honey"}'),
