wild goose chases, and a hilarious showdown at the annual Greek festival.  Amidst the chaos, Toula must navigate the family drama while trying to keep her own life from falling apart.  In the end, the family learns that love and forgiveness are the most important ingredients of all.',	'poster_798.png',	'{"actors":"David Brown","director":"Mia Jones","genres":"comedy,  romance","plot":"The Portokalos family is thrown into chaos when Toula''s Aunt Voula discovers a long-lost family recipe for a legendary Greek dish, sparking a bitter rivalry with her sister, Maria.  The feud escalates when Maria''s beloved cat, Zorba, goes missing, leading to accusations, wild goose chases, and a hilarious showdown at the annual Greek festival.  Amidst the chaos, Toula must navigate the family drama while trying to keep her own life from falling apart.  In the end, the family learns that love and forgiveness are the most important ingredients of all.","rating":"4.4","released":2017,"runtime_mins":165,"title":"My Big Fat Greek Wedding 7: The Family Feud Gets Physical (Zorba the Cat Gets Involved)"}'),
