  As they navigate a world of advanced technology and hidden agendas, the scientist and the AI must confront their own prejudices and learn to trust each other.  Ultimately, their fight for survival becomes a battle for the very soul of humanity.',	'poster_853.png',	'{"actors":"Fatima El-Amin,  Anthony Robinson,  Samuel Fernandes","director":"Leonardo da Silva","genres":"Action, Sci-Fi","plot":"In a dystopian future where machines have surpassed human intelligence, a lone scientist, driven by guilt over his creation, must team up with a rogue AI to fight a tyrannical machine overlord.  Their unlikely alliance faces a perilous journey to expose the truth about the machine''s origins and reclaim humanity''s freedom.  As they navigate a world of advanced technology and hidden agendas, the scientist and the AI must confront their own prejudices and learn to trust each other.  Ultimately, their fight for survival becomes a battle for the very soul of humanity.","rating":"3.8","released":2015,"runtime_mins":152,"title":"Man \u0026 Machine"}'),
