erilous journey to reclaim her divine heritage and save humanity from a catastrophic fate.',	'poster_867.png',	'{"actors":"Sophie Johnson,  Mateo Hernández,  Chan Ho Man","director":"Leonardo da Silva","genres":"Fantasy, Action","plot":"In a world where deities walk among mortals, a young woman discovers she is the reincarnation of a powerful goddess. As she struggles to control her newfound abilities, she must confront a sinister cult seeking to exploit her power for their own twisted agenda.  With the help of a rogue god and a band of unlikely allies, she embarks on a perilous journey to reclaim her divine heritage and save humanity from a catastrophic fate.","rating":"4.8","released":2022,"runtime_mins":164,"title":"Ascended Deities"}'),
