his endless cycle.  Ultimately, she must choose between accepting her fate or fighting for a future where she can finally find true love and freedom.',	'poster_904.png',	'{"actors":"Cody Tsosie,  Krishna Choudhury,  Julien David","director":"Jakob Weber","genres":"fantasy, romance","plot":"A young woman, haunted by recurring dreams of a past life, discovers she''s trapped in a cycle of reincarnation.  With each life, she relives the same tragic love story, searching for a way to break the curse.  As she unravels the secrets of her past, she must confront the truth about her own soul and the choices that bind her to this endless cycle.  Ultimately, she must choose between accepting her fate or fighting for a future where she can finally find true love and freedom.","rating":"4.7","released":2006,"runtime_mins":56,"title":"Wheel of Rebirth"}'),
