nd the true nature of their blissful embrace.',	'poster_905.png',	'{"actors":"Cheung Wai Kin,  Finn Müller","director":"Lina Werner","genres":"Romance, Fantasy","plot":"A reclusive artist, haunted by a tragic past, finds solace in the company of a mysterious woman who claims to be his soulmate. As their bond deepens, he discovers her connection to a hidden world of ancient magic and forbidden love.  But when the line between reality and fantasy blurs, he must confront the truth about his past and the true nature of their blissful embrace.","rating":"1.3","released":2018,"runtime_mins":134,"title":"Blissful Embrace"}'),
