 a path to inner peace and a renewed sense of purpose, but must confront the consequences of his newfound enlightenment.',	'poster_906.png',	'{"actors":"Panikpak Hansen,  Benjamin Carvalho","director":"Amina Mohamed","genres":"Drama, Thriller","plot":"A cynical, burnt-out journalist, disillusioned with the world, is assigned to write a piece on a reclusive spiritual guru. Initially skeptical, he finds himself drawn into the guru''s teachings, questioning his own beliefs and facing his inner demons. As he delves deeper into the guru''s philosophy, he discovers a path to inner peace and a renewed sense of purpose, but must confront the consequences of his newfound enlightenment.","rating":"2.9","released":2008,"runtime_mins":51,"title":"Path to Enlightenment"}'),
