rcial success.  Ultimately, he learns that true fulfillment comes from embracing his authentic self and the power of his hidden potential.',	'poster_907.png',	'{"actors":"Felipe Fuentes","director":"Daniel Costa","genres":"Drama, Comedy","plot":"A struggling artist, disillusioned with his lack of success, discovers a hidden talent for a unique form of art.  His newfound passion reignites his spirit, but he must overcome his own self-doubt and the skepticism of those around him to embrace his true potential.  As he gains recognition, he faces a difficult choice: stay true to his artistic vision or compromise for commercial success.  Ultimately, he learns that true fulfillment comes from embracing his authentic self and the power of his hidden potential.","rating":"2.6","released":2024,"runtime_mins":68,"title":"Hidden Potential"}'),
