me grows, he faces a choice: to stay true to his art or succumb to the demands of the art world.  In the end, he learns that true genius lies not in the strokes on the canvas, but in the courage to paint his own story.',	'poster_29.png',	'{"title":"Strokes of Genius","runtime_mins":51,"genres":"drama, thriller","rating":"3.6","released":2015,"actors":"Fiona Gallagher,  Isabella Martínez","director":"Gabriele Moretti","plot":"\"Strokes of Genius\" follows a struggling artist who discovers a hidden talent for painting after a near-fatal accident.  His newfound ability attracts the attention of a renowned art dealer, but the artist must confront his past demons and the pressure of success to truly embrace his genius.  As his fame grows, he faces a choice: to stay true to his art or succumb to the demands of the art world.  In the end, he learns that true genius lies not in the strokes on the canvas, but in the courage to paint his own story."}'),
