or risk losing himself entirely.  The film explores the power of love, loss, and the seductive nature of obsession.',	'poster_41.png',	'{"title":"The Lovers Requiem","runtime_mins":95,"genres":"Drama, Thriller","rating":"1.9","released":2005,"actors":"Chan Ka Chun,  Tiffany Ho,  Aoife Murphy","director":"Devansh Desai","plot":"A renowned composer, haunted by the tragic death of his beloved wife, finds solace in composing a requiem for her. As he delves deeper into the music, he begins to hear her voice, blurring the lines between reality and grief.  Driven by his obsession, he seeks to recreate her through the music, ultimately facing a chilling choice: to embrace the beauty of his grief or risk losing himself entirely.  The film explores the power of love, loss, and the seductive nature of obsession."}'),
