 he finds himself battling not only the encroaching darkness but also the growing hopelessness within himself.  In a desperate attempt to save humanity, he must confront the ultimate question: can hope truly exist in the face of endless despair?',	'poster_51.png',	'{"title":"Endless Despair","runtime_mins":162,"genres":"Horror, Thriller","rating":"3.9","released":2011,"actors":"Zofia Nowak,  Rohan Kumar,  Zoé Simon","director":"Ian Bell","plot":"A brilliant but troubled scientist, driven by a desire to understand the universe''s mysteries, accidentally unlocks a portal to a dimension of pure, unadulterated despair.  As the despair begins to seep into our world, he must race against time to find a way to close the portal before it consumes everything.  But the despair is contagious, and he finds himself battling not only the encroaching darkness but also the growing hopelessness within himself.  In a desperate attempt to save humanity, he must confront the ultimate question: can hope truly exist in the face of endless despair?"}'),
