d dreams, and together they find solace and strength in their shared passion. As they create art together, they rediscover the power of hope and the beauty of human connection.',	'poster_67.png',	'{"title":"A Glimmer of Hope","runtime_mins":178,"genres":"Drama, Adventure","rating":"2.3","released":2010,"actors":"Miriam Makeba,  Julian Sanders,  Sophie Walsh","director":"Teina Brown","plot":"A disillusioned young artist, struggling to find her voice, stumbles upon a hidden journal filled with the vibrant dreams of a long-lost relative. Inspired by the forgotten passion, she embarks on a journey to rediscover her own artistic spirit. Along the way, she encounters a community of forgotten artists, each carrying their own burdens and dreams, and together they find solace and strength in their shared passion. As they create art together, they rediscover the power of hope and the beauty of human connection."}'),
