her past and the true meaning of compassion, ultimately leading to a choice that will forever change the fate of her kingdom.',	'poster_70.png',	'{"title":"The Queens Compassion","runtime_mins":187,"genres":"Historical, Fantasy","rating":"2.8","released":2015,"actors":"David Ma,  Kayla Morgan","director":"Emily Chan","plot":"Queen Elara, known for her icy demeanor and ruthless rule, is forced to confront her own humanity when a devastating plague sweeps through her kingdom.  As the people suffer, Elara must choose between clinging to her power or risking everything to find a cure, even if it means humbling herself before a rival queen.  The journey forces Elara to confront her past and the true meaning of compassion, ultimately leading to a choice that will forever change the fate of her kingdom."}'),
