long-forgotten prophecy. Ultimately, she must choose between her own desires and the divine calling that has been revealed to her.',	'poster_77.png',	'{"title":"Divine Devotion","runtime_mins":133,"genres":"Drama, Fantasy","rating":"1.7","released":2021,"actors":"Wei Chen,  Khaled Hosseini,  Hakim Abdullah","director":"Mariam Diallo","plot":"A young woman, disillusioned with her life, embarks on a pilgrimage to a remote monastery seeking spiritual guidance. There, she encounters a wise and enigmatic monk who challenges her beliefs and forces her to confront her own inner demons. As she delves deeper into her faith, she discovers a hidden truth about the monastery and its connection to a long-forgotten prophecy. Ultimately, she must choose between her own desires and the divine calling that has been revealed to her."}'),
