ge to outsmart his rivals and claim the golden windfall.  But the true treasure he discovers is the strength of his own spirit and the power of friendship.',	'poster_83.png',	'{"title":"A Golden Windfall","runtime_mins":181,"genres":"Action, Adventure","rating":"4.4","released":2008,"actors":"Austin Flores","director":"Emiliano Ramirez","plot":"A struggling artist, desperate for money, discovers a hidden treasure map in an antique shop.  He embarks on a perilous journey to find the buried gold, but soon finds himself entangled in a web of deceit and danger as others, including a ruthless treasure hunter, are also seeking the fortune.  As the artist races against time, he must rely on his wits and courage to outsmart his rivals and claim the golden windfall.  But the true treasure he discovers is the strength of his own spirit and the power of friendship."}'),
