, they must learn to trust each other and overcome their own demons to survive and claim the gold.  But the true treasure may not be the gold itself, but the bonds they forge along the way.',	'poster_85.png',	'{"title":"Pirate Gold","runtime_mins":61,"genres":"Action, Adventure","rating":"2.2","released":2024,"actors":"Grace Jones,  Gaia Leone,  Léa Moreau","director":"Nurbolat Akhmetov","plot":"A washed-up treasure hunter, haunted by a past expedition gone wrong, is offered a chance to redeem himself by finding the legendary \"Pirate Gold.\"  He reluctantly accepts, joining a ragtag crew of misfits on a perilous journey to a remote island rumored to hold the treasure.  As they face treacherous storms, deadly traps, and rival treasure hunters, they must learn to trust each other and overcome their own demons to survive and claim the gold.  But the true treasure may not be the gold itself, but the bonds they forge along the way."}'),
