ltimately, she must choose between clinging to the whispers of the past or embracing a new future.',	'poster_90.png',	'{"title":"Whispers on the Breeze","runtime_mins":53,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"1.5","released":2010,"actors":"Filippo Rinaldi,  Musa Okello","director":"Brian Green","plot":"A reclusive artist living on a remote island is haunted by whispers on the wind, believing them to be messages from her deceased lover. As she delves deeper into the mystery, she uncovers a hidden history of the island and a dark secret that threatens to consume her.  The whispers become more insistent, urging her to confront her past and the truth about her lover''s death.  Ultimately, she must choose between clinging to the whispers of the past or embracing a new future."}'),
