 knew.  Haunted by the weight of his newfound truths, he must decide whether to expose the darkness or protect the people he loves, even if it means sacrificing his own integrity.',	'poster_150.png',	'{"title":"Truths Burden","runtime_mins":183,"genres":"Thriller, Drama","rating":"2.6","released":2015,"actors":"Mia Gomes","director":"Erica Cooper","plot":"A renowned journalist, known for his unwavering pursuit of truth, is forced to confront his own past when a shocking revelation about his family''s history threatens to unravel his carefully constructed life. As he digs deeper into the secrets buried within his family''s legacy, he uncovers a web of lies and betrayals that challenge everything he thought he knew.  Haunted by the weight of his newfound truths, he must decide whether to expose the darkness or protect the people he loves, even if it means sacrificing his own integrity."}'),
