er.  But the truth she uncovers is more terrifying than she could have imagined, and she must choose between facing her demons or succumbing to the darkness that threatens to swallow her whole.  The line between reality and delusion blurs as she fights to escape the burden of her loneliness and the secrets that',	'poster_156.png',	'{"title":"Loneliness Burden","runtime_mins":121,"genres":"Thriller, Horror","rating":"1.9","released":2011,"actors":"Ava Davies,  Nikhil Agarwal,  James Gallagher","director":"Christian Fisher","plot":"A reclusive artist, haunted by a tragic past, finds solace in her art, but her isolation deepens when she discovers a mysterious, abandoned cabin in the woods.  As she delves into the cabin''s secrets, she uncovers a chilling connection to her own past, forcing her to confront the loneliness that has consumed her.  But the truth she uncovers is more terrifying than she could have imagined, and she must choose between facing her demons or succumbing to the darkness that threatens to swallow her whole.  The line between reality and delusion blurs as she fights to escape the burden of her loneliness and the secrets that"}'),
