veness.  The journey forces her to confront the true meaning of forgiveness and its power to heal both the giver and the receiver.',	'poster_158.png',	'{"title":"Forgiveness Unconditional","runtime_mins":48,"genres":"Drama, Thriller","rating":"1.4","released":2001,"actors":"Brittany Jackson","director":"Jamal Ali","plot":"After a tragic accident takes the life of her husband, Sarah vows to never forgive the reckless driver responsible. Years later, she discovers the driver is battling a terminal illness and seeks her forgiveness.  Torn between her grief and the chance for redemption, Sarah must confront her own anger and decide if she can truly offer unconditional forgiveness.  The journey forces her to confront the true meaning of forgiveness and its power to heal both the giver and the receiver."}'),
