ir lives, threatening to disrupt the fragile balance they''ve built.  Sarah must ultimately choose between the love she has always known and the possibility of a new beginning.',	'poster_164.png',	'{"title":"Love Unwavering","runtime_mins":90,"genres":"Drama, Romance","rating":"1.8","released":2017,"actors":"Madison Hughes,  Miguel Ángel Santos,  Aputsiaq Jensen","director":"Kofi Annan","plot":"After a tragic accident leaves her fiancé paralyzed, Sarah is torn between her unwavering love for him and the overwhelming pressure to move on.  As she navigates the challenges of their new reality, she discovers the true meaning of love and commitment, finding strength in the face of adversity.  However, a mysterious stranger enters their lives, threatening to disrupt the fragile balance they''ve built.  Sarah must ultimately choose between the love she has always known and the possibility of a new beginning."}'),
