e against time to break the curse before the witch''s malevolent power consumes the town and its inhabitants.',	'poster_348.png',	'{"actors":"Hannah Lynch,  Zachary Cooper","director":"David Hoffmann","genres":"Horror, Thriller","plot":"In a small, isolated town shrouded in superstition, a young woman named Clara discovers a hidden journal detailing a centuries-old curse that binds the town to a powerful witch. As the clock strikes midnight on the eve of the full moon, the curse awakens, unleashing a wave of supernatural terror. Now, Clara must race against time to break the curse before the witch''s malevolent power consumes the town and its inhabitants.","rating":"2.2","released":2011,"runtime_mins":180,"title":"Witching Hour"}'),
