wn reality before it''s too late.  The film explores themes of free will, destiny, and the nature of reality itself.',	'poster_357.png',	'{"actors":"Elias Schneider","director":"Chan Wai Shan","genres":"Science Fiction, Thriller","plot":"A brilliant but reclusive scientist discovers a way to travel between parallel universes.  He uses his invention to escape a life of tragedy, but soon realizes the alternate realities he''s jumping between are not as idyllic as he hoped.  As the lines between universes blur, he must confront the consequences of his actions and find a way to return to his own reality before it''s too late.  The film explores themes of free will, destiny, and the nature of reality itself.","rating":"2.9","released":2002,"runtime_mins":81,"title":"Parallel Universe"}'),
